    "updated_at": "2023-10-18T21:35:02Z",
    "body": "> We wouldn't want `<slot dir=rtl>` to be treated as if it said `<slot dir=auto>`.\r\n\r\nFor what it's worth, this rule in the spec only affects `<slot>` elements *without* a `dir` attribute, since we'll skip any with a `dir` attribute in the previous step.",
