    "body": "Thanks for mentioning that. That makes me wonder, if #9853 is applied, how would you hit this step?\r\n\r\nBecause wouldn't the previous step continue for any _descendant_ that is\r\n\r\n> a [slot](https://whatpr.org/html/9863/scripting.html#the-slot-element) element whose [root](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root) is a [shadow root](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-root)\r\n\r\n?",
