    "updated_at": "2023-10-19T12:32:01Z",
    "body": "OK, what I intended is really that the \"slot element\" item should be removed from the previous list and should just fall through to this bullet, because the \"an element whose [dir](https://whatpr.org/html/9863/dom.html#attr-dir) attribute is not in the [undefined](https://whatpr.org/html/9863/dom.html#attr-dir-undefined-state) state\", plus this bullet, is enough.\r\n\r\nMaybe it makes sense to merge these two PRs since they're too inter-related at this point?",
